  m_text: "\"Penquin runner\" is an engaging 2D platformer game where players navigate
    through two uniquely themed stages filled with dynamic obstacles. The game's
    goal is to collect coins while avoiding obstacles, aiming to complete each stage
    within a limited number of lives (3 lives). The project seeks to enhance user
    experience through intuitive controls, immersive graphics, and a balanced difficulty
    level, making it enjoyable for both casual gamers and platformer enthusiasts.
    \r\n "
